IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/52nd-Annual-Houston-Shakespeare-Festival-T
 he-Tempest-at-Miller-Outdoor-Theatre.jpeg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/52nd-Annual-Houston-Shakespeare-Festival-The-Tempest-at-Miller-Ou
 tdoor-Theatre.jpeg
UID:TnM2ArnmJgX1MUMIJI8a5
SUMMARY:52nd Annual Houston Shakespeare Festival: The Tempest at Miller Out
	door Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260802T101936Z
DTSTART:20260807T201500Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Shakespeare Festival\, the city’s annual summer theater
	 tradition\, celebrates its 52nd season with performances of both The Temp
	est and Comedy of Errors on alternating nights at Miller Outdoor Theatre. 
	\nShakespeare’s The Tempest\nExiled by her brother to a remote island and 
	left to die\, Prospera—the once loved Duchess of Milan and now an all-powe
	rful sorceress—conjures a great tempest to wash ashore a ship of her enemi
	es. \nWith the power of magic\, Prospera manipulates the survivors of the 
	wreckage to weave a story of revenge\, retribution\, and reconciliation. R
	ich with spectacle\, humor and wonder\, Shakespeare’s final play brings au
	diences to a “brave new world ” where reconciliation is possible and human
	ity is renewed. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre\nAs always\,
	 all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening sh
	ows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance. 
	\nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFre
	e. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Featured Calendar
	 Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar 
	with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your event\, o
	rganization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.\n\nhttps://3
	65thingsinhouston.com/calendar/52nd-annual-houston-shakespeare-festival-th
	e-tempest-at-miller-outdoor-theatre-5/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/52nd-annual-houston-shakespeare
	-festival-the-tempest-at-miller-outdoor-theatre-5/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 770
	30\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/DroneArt-Show-Harry-Potter-at-Constellatio
 n-Field-1.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/05/DroneArt-Show-Harry-Potter-at-Constellation-Field-1.jpg
UID:plKbnCCuJ-sVWnAEiO8sZ
SUMMARY:DroneArt Show: Harry Potter at Constellation Field
DTSTAMP:20260802T101936Z
DTSTART:20260807T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:DroneArt Show returns to Houston with an official Harry Potter 
	light show in the sky at Constellation Field in Sugar Land. The show promi
	ses to be an unforgettable open-air spectacle as 1\,200 illuminated drones
	 recreate favorite characters and beloved moments from the Harry Potter fi
	lms. \nAs night falls\, hundreds of synchronized illuminated drones take o
	ff and create shapes in the sky\, moving in time with John Williams’ movie
	 score played live in a 65-minute performance. \n\nInspired by the Wizardi
	ng World\, the show ensures every guest takes part in the experience with 
	exclusive LED wristbands. \n\n\n\nThe open air setting will have food and 
	drink for sale. Plus—whether you’re sorted into houses Gryffindor\, Huffle
	puff\, Ravenclaw or Slytherin—costumes and Wizarding World attire are high
	ly encouraged. \n\nAdmission\nTickets start at $48\; $28 for ages 3 to 11.
	 Order tickets or learn more.   This Featured Calendar Listing was sponsor
	ed by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more
	 details. Learn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\
	, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/
	calendar/droneart-show-harry-potter-at-constellation-field-1/\n\nFrom 365 
	Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/droneart-show-harry-potter-at-c
	onstellation-field-1/
LOCATION:Constellation Field\, 1 Stadium Dr\, Sugar Land\, TX\, 77498\, Uni
	ted States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
